; claude: SketchUp's model and its screen (SketchUp, @Last Software,
; 2000): a model of edges and the faces they bound, push/pull, the
; stickiness of shared vertices (Skp_model); the inference engine that
; guesses what a point in 3D means from a point on the screen
; (Skp_infer); the camera orbiting what you build (Skp_view); and the
; BSP tree that draws the faces in order without a z-buffer (Bsp).
; Used by TinySketchup. In the package tiny_appkits, as
; tiny_appkits.appkit_pushpull: pure OCaml.
(library
 (name appkit_pushpull)
 (public_name tiny_appkits.appkit_pushpull)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries
   graphics_3d_geometry ; Vec3, Camera
 )
)
